# Acknowledgments & Data Sources

## Data Sources

This project uses data from the following sources:

### 1. IPUMS USA
- **Provider:** University of Minnesota
- **Website:** [https://www.ipums.org](https://www.ipums.org)
- **Description:** U.S. census and survey data covering 17 million full-time worker records (1994-2023)

### 2. Adult Income Prediction Dataset
- **Provider:** Kaggle / Mosa P. Abdelghany
- **URL:** [https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/mosapabdelghany/adult-income-prediction-dataset](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/mosapabdelghany/adult-income-prediction-dataset)

